Starting next Monday, the Central Library will introduce self-service machines for borrowing and returning books. The machines are located near the main entrance and are {{1}} to use. Simply scan your library card and place your books on the reader.

Library staff will be available throughout the first week to help users {{2}} the new system. {{3}}

The introduction of the machines will allow our staff to spend more time {{4}} visitors with research and other requests.

The Lyon Museum of Science will open a new permanent exhibition on renewable energy next month. The exhibition, which was developed {{1}} three years, features interactive displays on solar, wind, and hydroelectric power.

Visitors will be able to {{2}} a model wind turbine and see how much electricity it produces. {{3}}

Admission to the exhibition is included in the general museum ticket. Schools can book guided tours, {{4}} are offered in French, English, and German.
